<!-- 1. HERO: the offer, the gate, the plan -->
<section class="hero hero2">
  <div class="wrap grid">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker">Free marathon pace plan</div>
      <h1>What's your <em>goal time?</em></h1>
      <p class="lede short">Drag the clock. Get the time to hit at every 10K sign.</p>

      <div class="label clockcard" id="get-plan">
        <div class="body">
          <form id="planForm" novalidate>
            <div class="clock" id="clock">
              <div class="clock-top"><span class="live"></span>Your finish time<span class="clock-tag" id="clockTag">Goal</span></div>
              <div class="clock-time"><span id="gpTime">3:45</span><small>:00</small></div>
              <input type="range" id="pf-slider" min="180" max="330" step="5" value="225" aria-label="Goal time">
              <div class="clock-scale"><span>3:00</span><span>4:15</span><span>5:30</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="splits" id="splits">
              <div class="sp open"><small>10K sign</small><b id="sp10">54:00</b><i>Free</i></div>
              <div class="sp"><small>20K sign</small><b id="sp20">1:46</b><i>🔒</i></div>
              <div class="sp"><small>30K sign</small><b id="sp30">2:39</b><i>🔒</i></div>
              <div class="sp"><small>40K sign</small><b id="sp40">3:32</b><i>🔒</i></div>
            </div>
            <label class="chk nsure"><input type="checkbox" id="pf-notsure"> I don't have a goal yet</label>
            <div class="row2">
              <div class="field"><label class="f" for="pf-race">Your race</label>
                <select id="pf-race" required>
                  <option value="">Pick your race</option>
                  <option>Dublin</option><option>Frankfurt</option><option>New York</option>
                  <option>Valencia</option><option>Seville</option><option>Barcelona</option>
                  <option>Paris</option><option>London</option><option>Manchester</option>
                  <option>Belfast</option><option>Cork</option><option>Other</option>
                </select></div>
              <div class="field"><label class="f" for="pf-email">Your email</label><input id="pf-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required></div>
            </div>
            <div hidden><select id="pf-goal" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></select></div>
            <div class="field" id="pf-other-wrap" hidden><label class="f" for="pf-other">Which race?</label><input id="pf-other" type="text" placeholder="e.g. Berlin, spring 2027"></div>
            <button class="btn" type="submit">Unlock my free plan <span class="arr">→</span></button>
            <div class="err" id="pf-err"></div>
            <p class="fine">Free, no card. Your plan shows here instantly, so no spam folder can hide it. Unsubscribe in one click.</p>
          </form>

          <!-- the plan, built in the browser the moment they sign up -->
          <div class="plan" id="plan" aria-live="polite" hidden>
            <div class="kicker" id="planKicker">Your plan</div>
            <h3 class="title" id="planTitle"></h3>
            <p class="muted" id="planSub" style="margin:0"></p>
            <div class="signs" id="planSigns"></div>
            <table class="stages"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Watch pace</th><th>Effort</th></tr></thead><tbody id="planStages"></tbody></table>
            <b>Gels: 30g each, with 3 or 4 sips of water</b>
            <div class="gelbar" id="planGels"></div>
            <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px;margin:30px 0 0" id="planCarry"></p>
            <div class="rules">
              <p><b>Lose time?</b> A portaloo or a busy drink station? Up to 2 minutes, go straight back to your pace and don't sprint to win it back. More than 2, take it back 5 seconds a K over the next 10K, never in one go.</p>
              <p><b>Pace and sign disagree?</b> Trust the clock at the sign. Your watch reads about 1% long.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="actions">
              <button class="btn" type="button" id="saveLock">Save to lock screen</button>
              <button class="btn white" type="button" id="printBand" style="border:2px solid var(--ink)">Print a pace band</button>
            </div>
            <div class="inbox-note">
              <h4>Your copy is on its way, probably to the wrong folder</h4>
              We've emailed this plan to <b id="planEmail"></b>. Screenshot it now anyway. Then find our email so the next ones land:
              <ul>
                <li><b>Gmail:</b> check Promotions and Spam. Found it? Tap "Not spam", or drag it to Primary.</li>
                <li><b>Outlook or Hotmail:</b> check Junk and tap "Not junk".</li>
                <li><b>iPhone Mail:</b> check the Junk folder.</li>
              </ul>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0">Search for "Engine Room". Questions about your plan? Reply to that email. Luke reads every one.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="morning">
              <div class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:8px">Race morning, before your plan starts</div>
              <ol class="mtl">
                <li><b>3 hours before</b>About 2g of carbs per kg. At 70kg that's 140g: two white bagels with jam and a glass of juice is about 150g.</li>
                <li class="hot"><b>Before the gun</b>Another 30g in the start pen, when nerves have killed your appetite. A banana does it. So will our Carb Bar, once the first batch is out.</li>
                <li><b>20 minutes in</b>Your first gel. Then the plan above takes over.</li>
              </ol>
              <div class="wl" id="wlAsk">
                <img src="{{ 'ern-carb-bar-pack.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="The ERN Carb Bar pack" width="120" height="78">
                <div><b>Want first go at the bar?</b> 30g of carbs in a rice crisp square. The first batch is small, and the waitlist hears first.
                  <div><button class="btn sm" id="wlYes" type="button">Yes, add me</button><button class="linkbtn" id="wlNo" type="button">No thanks</button></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <p id="wlThanks" hidden style="margin-top:12px"><b>You're on the waitlist.</b> You'll hear about the bar before anyone else.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- proof beside the button -->
    <div class="proofstack">
      <div class="mega"><b>1,000,000+</b><span>views on our marathon videos</span></div>
      <div class="pcard green"><small>Dave · Dublin Marathon</small><b>−45 min</b><span>off his marathon time</span></div>
      <div class="pcard blue"><small>Ellie · Frankfurt Marathon</small><b>Sub-3</b><span>a sub-3-hour marathon</span></div>
      <div class="pcard ink"><small>Conor · Málaga Marathon</small><b>2:47</b><span>with our plan</span></div>
      <div class="dm">"Not to get emotional, but you made my day with the plan."<span>Caroline · 13 minutes off, Dublin</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="madeby" href="#us">{%- if section.settings.founders_photo -%}{{ section.settings.founders_photo | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: alt: "Luke and Jamie", loading: "lazy" }}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'founders.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Luke and Jamie" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<span><b>Made by Luke &amp; Jamie</b>Two runners who hit the wall and did the maths →</span></a>
    <div class="proofstrip">
      <div class="faces"><i>D</i><i>E</i><i>C</i><i>T</i><i>C</i></div>
      <p><b>Dave −45 min · Ellie sub-3 · Conor 2:47 · Tom 3:19</b><span>1M+ views · 100+ free plans sent</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

